---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { imageDimensions } from '../data/media';
---
<section class="attention-preview" aria-labelledby="attention-preview-title">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">A question can leave the terminal</p><h2 id="attention-preview-title">The answer comes back.<br /><em>The work moves on.</em></h2><p>Codex needs a layout choice. Attention brings the question into the Mac app, returns the selected answer to the waiting terminal, and the same task builds the page.</p><blockquote><span>The recorded choice</span><strong>Session cards</strong><p>The result is a responsive workshop page with three session cards.</p></blockquote><a class="button button-dark" href="/labs/attention/">Watch the terminal-to-Mac round trip <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a><p class="attention-preview-scope">Actual shared Attention MCP and released Mac app. Automated native choice; fictional workshop. The resulting file is available to download.</p></div>
  <figure><a href="/labs/attention/" aria-label="Watch the actual terminal and Mac question recording"><img src="/media/attention/poster.png" {...imageDimensions('/media/attention/poster.png')} alt="The actual Codex terminal acknowledges Session cards beside the native Mac card confirming that answer." loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption>Two views of one live task: the waiting terminal and its native question.</figcaption><a class="text-link" href="/labs/question/">Another path: answer inside native chat <Icon name="arrow-up-right" /></a></figure>
</section>
<style>
  .attention-preview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;gap:45px;padding:35px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#e9ecdf;border-radius:4px;align-items:center}
  .attention-preview .eyebrow{color:var(--rust);margin-bottom:18px}.attention-preview h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,3.4vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:22px}.attention-preview h2 em{color:var(--forest)}
  .attention-preview p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.75}.attention-preview blockquote{margin:22px 0;padding:15px 19px;border-left:3px solid var(--forest);background:var(--paper)}.attention-preview blockquote>span{display:block;font-size:.62rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted)}.attention-preview blockquote>strong{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:500;margin-block:5px}.attention-preview blockquote p{font-size:.8rem}
  .attention-preview .button{font-size:.78rem}.attention-preview .attention-preview-scope{font-size:.72rem;margin-top:16px;max-width:510px;line-height:1.65}.attention-preview figure{margin:0;min-width:0}.attention-preview img{width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--line)}.attention-preview figcaption{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;line-height:1.7}.attention-preview figure .text-link{font-size:.75rem;margin-top:18px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.attention-preview{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;padding:25px}.attention-preview h2{font-size:2.5rem}.attention-preview p{font-size:.9rem}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.attention-preview{padding:22px 18px}.attention-preview h2{font-size:2.2rem}.attention-preview .button{font-size:.75rem;gap:10px}}
</style>
